    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/5649dfa3fe256e70f64967242f9cc592.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Cavern is a Roguelike Sandbox  with\u00a0RPG  elements!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/5649dfa3fe256e70f64967242f9cc592.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every situation presents a unique challenge and a unique solution whether you decide to fight or meddle. Each character has the ability to swap out objects in the game at will, along with unique characteristics. As you go deeper into the Cavern, the level generation becomes more chaotic, and you will gain more control... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/a4e502c3c10d68a98d499f527816846e.poster.avif?t=1755061257\" width=198 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/a4e502c3c10d68a98d499f527816846e.webm?t=1755061257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/a4e502c3c10d68a98d499f527816846e.mp4?t=1755061257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap a rock into a bomb to clear terrain,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap a harmless pot into a slime to fight on your side,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap a skeleton's sword into a useless stick,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or swap cobwebs into shiny gems to distract an enemy,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/f24c654c490ca559ecb4b0a537a51c00.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/0e21062c192870ec11aa67dc8011fb39.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/95ee97351273c4aac8564ca3258d9df4.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features - Currently In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/3ba967bca6ac313c25b8e9efd7f752da.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Unique Swapping Mechanic that turns every run into a sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/0512d9b1afb9a855ebbfe31b09c6bb52.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Anomaly System that changes the game as you play, presenting you with fresh challenges and unique opportunities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/e852bd9701b0876c419b17716992514f.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Procedurally Generated Levels with Seeding Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/4e937869c35db43615a826f2b9df5df9.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Artifacts that enhance or mutate your strategy per run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/284b0138457ab4f91c6602fddd5bfffb.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Perma-Death </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/408a551b5489c42605718d7f0a908209.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Specialized Characters with unique move sets and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/785e5167552c838536a343e184ea2881.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0Challenging Bosses &amp; Enemies  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/93f69805d0516b9c38dd8073a2b58064.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0A Humorous Narrative with Epic Cutscenes that will pull at your Heart Strings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/12454b9cdc1bf610efc2de75ec1685ce.webp?t=1755061257\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0swag</p>",
